Subject: [PATCH 08/23] Distant beacon fix, merge NHblock commits, Create
 persistence & profiling

Add distant beacon beam rendering from stored voxels (BeaconBeamSolver, BeaconIndex, DistantBeaconRenderer) and persist aux tables to storage (StorageBackend/SectionStorage adapters, RocksDB aux column families). Add Create client features: contraption snapshot storage, visibility culling, GPU/heap budgeting, kinetic/contraption memory reports, and various renderer/stencil/frustum optimizations. Improve model bakery robustness, GPU timing/profile capture (VoxyProfile), ingest improvements for chunkless sections, config/UI updates, version bump to 0.3.2, and maintainer/repo metadata updates.
